    "title": "Purdue vs Miami schedule, TV channel, how to watch March Madness game",
    "text": "Updated March 21, 2026, 2:33 p.m. MTNo. 2 seed Purdue and No. 7 seed Miami play in a March Madness NCAA Tournament men's college basketball game on Sunday, March 22.Here's what to know about the time, TV channel, streaming information and announcers for the West Region March Madness second-round game.Purdue defeated No. 15 seed Queens in the first round of the NCAA Tournament, 104-71.Miami beat No. 10 seed Missouri in the Round of 64 of March Madness, 80-66.The winner of this game will advance to the Sweet 16 of the NCAA Tournament.How to watch March Madness: Purdue vs Miami | Iowa State vs Kentucky | Kansas vs St. John's | Virginia vs Tennessee | Florida vs Iowa | Arizona vs Utah State | UConn vs UCLA | Alabama vs Texas Tech | Second-round game schedule, TV channels | AnnouncersWatch Purdue vs Miami on FUBO (free trial)What time is the Purdue vs Miami March Madness game?The Miami vs Purdue NCAA Tournament March Madness second-round game is scheduled for 9:10 a.m. MST on Sunday, March 22.Join the madness: USA TODAY Bracket Challenge | Survivor Pool | Printable bracket | Your picks vs expertsWhat channel is the Miami vs Purdue March Madness game on?The Purdue vs Miami Round of 32 March Madness NCAA Tournament game can be seen on CBS.March Madness picks: Purdue vs Miami | Iowa State vs Kentucky | Kansas vs St. John's | Virginia vs Tennessee | Florida vs Iowa | Arizona vs Utah State | UConn vs UCLA | Alabama vs Texas Tech | Second-round score predictionsHow can I stream the Purdue vs Miami March Madness game?Miami vs Purdue can be streamed on FUBO and other streaming services that carry CBS. FUBO offers a free trial.Who are the announcers for the Miami vs Purdue March Madness game?Spero Dedes will have the play-by-play call of the Purdue Boilermakers vs Miami Hurricanes NCAA Tournament Round of 32 game, with Jim Spanarkel as the analyst and Jon Rothstein as the reporter for the March Madness second-round matchup.March Madness odds: Purdue vs Miami | Iowa State vs Kentucky | Kansas vs St. John's | Virginia vs Tennessee | Florida vs Iowa | Arizona vs Utah State | UConn vs UCLA | Alabama vs Texas Tech | Second-round game odds | Title oddsReach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
